# Collect Tarut Cards (jeuno 10) with its era module (quest rework B3b Jeuno, P4): modules/era/lua/quests/jeuno/
# collect_tarut_cards.lua, enabled by its condition xi.pre(xi.expansion.ABYSSEA) (RESTRICT_CONTENT 1, ENABLE_ABYSSEA 0),
# replaces state 2's Lower Jeuno Chululu onTrigger with quest:event(27), the reminder, whatever the Date: no new batch
# (the quest's own plays Progress 10112 once GetSystemTime() is past Date, else Progress 27). Jeuno fame level 3: her
# 28 (the quest's own; option 0: five cards, begun, Date = the next JST midnight), 27 before Date, 27 a JST day later
# (past Date: the quest's own plays 10112), then the four cards (200, the quest's own: completed). The module's 27 is
# an Event, not a Progress event: #era_cycle shows it taking turns with another quest's Event.
# The condition's false side cannot be a module flow (the harness fails a flow whose module is not enabled); the
# quest's own flows are that side.
module modules/era/lua/quests/jeuno/collect_tarut_cards.lua
lists LowerJeuno/Chululu/onTrigger LowerJeuno/Chululu/onTrade LowerJeuno/onEventFinish/28 LowerJeuno/onEventFinish/10112 LowerJeuno/onEventFinish/200
char zone=LowerJeuno pos=-9,-6.7,-42.5 job=WAR lvl=30
setting RESTRICT_CONTENT 1
setting ENABLE_ABYSSEA 0
fame Sandoria 84
fame Bastok 83
fame Windurst 83
item TarutCardTheFool
item TarutCardDeath
item TarutCardTheHermit
item TarutCardTheKing
login
walk -11.5,-6.7,-42
trigger Chululu                             # available, fame level 3: 28 (the quest's own)
finish option=0                             # five of one random card; begun, Date = the next JST midnight
trigger Chululu                             # accepted, before Date: 27 (an Event)
finish
wait jst=1                                  # GetSystemTime past Date
trigger Chululu                             # past Date: 27 (the quest's own: 10112)
finish option=0
trade Chululu TarutCardTheFool x1 TarutCardDeath x1 TarutCardTheHermit x1 TarutCardTheKing x1  # the four: 200
finish                                      # completed: Card Collector, fame +7 x3, the cards taken, All in the Cards' Date
